  "name": "done-prepare-done-gate-parity",
  "title": "Make done_prepare enforce the real DONE finish-decision and reviewer-verdict predicates",
  "description": "Fix the confirmed B-aa5f done_prepare/DONE parity defect. Commit the executable RED proving that real DONE rejects a missing dev_memory_finish_decision and a stale reviewer scopeBinding.diffPackHash while the original done_prepare omitted both results; then make the unchanged test GREEN with matching missing_dev_memory_finish_decision and stale_closeout_review codes. Add the process-fact omission guard and the bounded selector-window evidence repair needed to keep this Story's own mechanical verification executable. This Story does not amend the Dynamic Finding System execution plan or its lifecycle gate predicates.",
